   "prev": [],
   "published": "2026-11-13 12:28:41",
   "remarks": "Floating LNG Terminal Finland Oy (\u201cFLTF\u201d), a 100 % subsidiary of Gasgrid Finland Oy, as the terminal operator for the FSRU (Floating Storage and Regasification Unit) vessel Exemplar, which is moored in the port of Inkoo in December 2022, clarifies following regarding Q1/2027 Slot bookings;\r\n-As per terminal rules capacity allocation requests of Spot Slots / Late Spot Slots is possible when done at least 30 calendar days before the start of the requested Scheduled Slots as per Annual Service Schedule. For January 1 (2027) slot this means that the slot is bookable as a Spot Slot up until 2.12.2026. If January 1 slot is not booked as a Spot Slot, Adjusted Late Spot Slots or Extension Service can be booked into this scheduled slot from 3.12.2026 onwards. \r\n",
